  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A few tests for fcrepo-storage-ocfl have been failing in windows (seen from the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-storage-ocfl/actions"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "github actions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Failed tests:   \n  touchingShouldUseTheTimestampFromTheLastUpdatedResource[0](org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSessionTest): Values should be different. Actual: 2024-05-17T11:49:06.274738Z\n  listAgVersions[1](org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSessionTest): (..)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It seems like these are intermittent failures as sometimes one or the other passes, and more recently both passes. This ticket is to keep an eye on if they continue to fail in the future, as this project is built relatively infrequently. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
