  "description": "<p>A few tests for fcrepo-storage-ocfl have been failing in windows (seen from the <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-storage-ocfl/actions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">github actions</a>):</p>\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>Failed tests:   \n  touchingShouldUseTheTimestampFromTheLastUpdatedResource[0](org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSessionTest): Values should be different. Actual: 2024-05-17T11:49:06.274738Z\n  listAgVersions[1](org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSessionTest): (..)</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>It seems like these are intermittent failures as sometimes one or the other passes, and more recently both passes. This ticket is to keep an eye on if they continue to fail in the future, as this project is built relatively infrequently. </p>",
